{
  "id": "app.nous.file-reader",
  "name": "破晓文件解析阅读器",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "api": "1.3",
  "requiresHost": "1.2.0",
  "description": "把文件拖进一个窗口，就地阅读、查看与修改。",
  "author": {
    "name": "Nelson",
    "url": "https://github.com/liveldy"
  },
  "changelog": [
    {
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-16",
      "changes": [
        "HTML 有了阅读视图：按白名单重建版式，脚本、外链样式与远程资源一律丢弃，只留正文、表格、代码与内联图片。",
        "压缩包可以解压：当前条目或全部条目解到左侧文件列表，再交给对应视图打开。",
        "左侧新增「关于」：支持的类型与版本、接口与宿主版本都在一处。",
        "打开过的文件进入「最近打开」，随宿主存储保留，可逐条删除或清空。",
        "空状态与描述文案收敛。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-16",
      "changes": [
        "首个版本：按魔数与扩展名识别文件，文本、代码、Markdown、表格、配置与结构化文档各有渲染视图。",
        "编辑器带语法着色、行号、缩进与括号成对处理，以及关键字、片段和文中标识符的补全提示。",
        "图像可缩放、旋转、镜像与矩形裁剪；音频解码成波形，可播放与圈选片段；视频用 WebCodecs 解码播放，可设入点出点。",
        "压缩包列目录并预览条目，docx、xlsx、pptx 直接抽出正文；PDF 抽文本层；STL、OBJ、PLY、GLB 出统计与面片、点云预览；其余二进制给签名解析和十六进制视图。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web",
    "windows-x64",
    "android-arm64"
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "storage",
    "clipboard.write",
    "external.open"
  ],
  "entry": "ui/index.html",
  "repository": "liveldy/Nous-Plugin-File-Reader",
  "license": "MIT",
  "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
  "navigation": [
    {
      "id": "reader",
      "label": "文件解析",
      "icon": "parse"
    }
  ],
  "defaultView": "reader",
  "requiredMethods": [],
  "optionalMethods": [
    "storage.get",
    "storage.set",
    "clipboard.write",
    "external.open"
  ],
  "resources": [
    "ui/index.html",
    "ui/style.css",
    "ui/app.js",
    "ui/nous-plugin.js",
    "ui/lib/detect.js",
    "ui/lib/text.js",
    "ui/lib/hl.js",
    "ui/lib/md.js",
    "ui/lib/structured.js",
    "ui/lib/htmlview.js",
    "ui/lib/codeview.js",
    "ui/lib/image.js",
    "ui/lib/audio.js",
    "ui/lib/mp4.js",
    "ui/lib/video.js",
    "ui/lib/zip.js",
    "ui/lib/model.js",
    "ui/lib/pdf.js",
    "ui/lib/binary.js",
    "ui/fonts/geist-latin.woff2",
    "ui/fonts/geistmono-latin.woff2",
    "ui/fonts/OFL.txt"
  ]
}
